{"id":"unterschiedlich","lemma":"unterschiedlich","pos":"adv","rank":4786,"glosses":["differently, in varying ways"],"ipa":"/ˈʊntɐˌʃiːtlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/De-unterschiedlich.ogg/De-unterschiedlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Warum sind wir unterschiedlich?","en":"Why are we different?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"we"},null]},{"text":"Denken Männer und Frauen unterschiedlich?","en":"Do men and women think differently?","words":[{"g":"to think"},{"g":"man, male human being","l":"Mann"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"woman","l":"Frau"},null]},{"text":"Die Menschen sind eben unterschiedlich.","en":"People are just different.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"just"},null]},{"text":"Sie sind bloß unterschiedlich.","en":"They're just different.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"merely, only"},null]},{"text":"Unsere Ziele sind sehr unterschiedlich.","en":"Our goals are very different.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"target","l":"Ziel"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]}]}